  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 — first release: boards as content with threads/posts/polls/reactions in transactional tables, guided installer, Community backoffice section with a unified moderation queue (shared with Community Comments) and suite-wide settings, always-on moderation rules engine with configurable blocked words/spam/promotional phrases and sensitivity, full-text search, RSS + sitemap + structured data, and optional AI-assisted moderation via Umbraco.AI. Fully free and ungated.",
